  "text": "Veterinarian in Orange Park, Florida and Jacksonville, FL | Southeast Veterinary Oncology & Internal Medicine (SEVO-Med)\nSkip to Primary Content\nSee Locations\nEmergency Care\nEmergency Care\nContact Us\nContact Us\nCall SEVO-Med: Orange Park\nCall SEVO-Med: Jacksonville\nAbout\nOur Story\nOur Team\nServices\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nAdvanced Diagnostics\nView all Services\nClient Resources\nClient Resources\nPayment Options\nVeterinary Referrals\nRefer a Patient\nReferral Guide\nCareers\nRefill Request\nSee Locations\nEmergency Care\nContact Us\nSoutheast Veterinary Oncology & Internal Medicine (SEVO-Med)\nInternal Medicine Service Update:\nOur Internal Medicine service is temporarily paused as we actively recruit a new specialist. We look forward to welcoming the right addition to our team and will share updates as soon as they are available.\nYour Pet, Our Priority\nHow can we help your family today?\nContact Us\nCancer does not define us. Hope Does.\nView all Services\nYour Pet, Our Priority\nHow can we help your family today?\nContact Us\nCancer does not define us. Hope Does.\nView all Services\nYour Pet, Our Priority\nHow can we help your family today?\nContact Us\nSEVO-Med\nServing the communities of Orange Park & Jacksonville, FL since 2004\nSoutheast Veterinary Oncology and Internal Medicine has two convenient locations to better serve you. Come see us in Orange Park, FL & Jacksonville, FL.\nSuccess is What We Strive For\nAt SEVO-Med, we truly love each animal that comes through our doors for treatment and our veterinary oncology and internal medicine practice is dedicated to providing the highest standard of care for you and your pet.\nClient Reviews & Testimonials\nWe at SEVO-Med have been dedicated to providing our care to the community since 2004, and we strive to treat your pets with the same care and compassion as if they were our own.\nJACKSONVILLE\nA thank you is just not enough to express how grateful I am to Sevo, all staff, and Doctor Neumann. The fact you are welcomed in a way that describes a warm safe hug and everything will be okay. I hope the staff knows you are changing the lives of our pets and us as pet parents.\nJoni C.\nORANGE PARK\nThe staff here is amazing the care is hands down the best I've ever received. They were very clear and helpful in explaining everything from care to cost.\nPaul N.\nJACKSONVILLE\nDr. Neumann and his staff are absolutely phenomenal. My sweet shar pei has mastocytosis—and the best doctors in the world to make her feel comfortable.\nSarah S.\nContact Us\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
